/t/p/original/30otCWQ1EzBmx98Q12OC0e5SDaF.jpg"},{"id":1377427,"name":"Igor Chometowski","role":"Additional Voices (voice)"},{"id":2966487,"name":"Adrien Larmande","role":"Additional Voices (voice)"},{"id":1751141,"name":"Antoine Lelandais","role":"Additional Voices (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKUSYtHw1epIf8axJWIOwUtmwZT.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La vetta degli dei","overview":"Furono George Mallory e il compagno Andrew Irvine i primi a scalare l'Everest l'8 giugno 1924? Solo la piccola macchina fotografica Kodak che portarono con sé potrebbe rivelare la verità. A Kathmandu, 70 anni dopo, un giovane reporter giapponese di nome Fukamachi riconosce la Kodak nelle mani del misterioso Habu Joji, un alpinista creduto disperso da anni. Ciò segna il suo ingresso in un mondo di ossessivi alpinisti, affamati di conquiste impossibili e desiderosi di raggiungere la vetta degli dei."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Summit of the Gods","overview":"A photojournalist's obsessive quest for the truth about the first expedition to Mt. Everest leads him to search for an esteemed climber who went missing."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"À Katmandou, le reporter japonais Fukamachi, croit reconnaître Habu Jôji, cet alpiniste que l'on pensait disparu depuis des années. Il semble tenir entre ses mains un appareil photo qui pourrait changer l’histoire de l’alpinisme. Et si George Mallory et Andrew Irvine étaient les premiers hommes à avoir atteint le sommet de l’Everest, le 8 juin 1924 ? Seul le petit Kodak Vest Pocket avec lequel ils devaient se photographier sur le toit du monde pourrait livrer la vérité. 70 ans plus tard, pour tenter de résoudre ce mystère, Fukamachi se lance sur les traces de Habu. Il découvre un monde de passionnés assoiffés de conquêtes impossibles et décide de l’accompagner jusqu’au voyage ultime vers le sommet des dieux.","tagline":"Une aventure hors du commun, au-delà des limites."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osCQSQ1KqzSITveM8aWIyOEXBb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Yqx44MZbBSQCW1OWFeuHwqQtWv.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":712454,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osCQSQ1KqzSITveM8aWIyOEXBb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osCQSQ1KqzSITveM8aWIyOEXBb.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osCQSQ1KqzSITveM8aWIyOEXBb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osCQSQ1KqzSITveM8aWIyOEXBb.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4spfa4tqgFi3sfD8y3OYJf0zNUq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4spfa4tqgFi3sfD8y3OYJf0zNUq.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nO4m5LXGxEBduH8IblZgA0Auefw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nO4m5LXGxEBduH8IblZgA0Auefw.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uzvwwdsTXIUweKYhp8Eo7uidzr5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uzvwwdsTXIUweKYhp8Eo7uidzr5.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uzvwwdsTXIUweKYhp8Eo7uidzr5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uzvwwdsTXIUweKYhp8Eo7uidzr5.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iowz7MwaTWMYlfLUE6GeM0m3Hze.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iowz7MwaTWMYlfLUE6GeM0m3Hze.jpg","language":"en","width":11